INDIA	475	15690798.45
INDONESIA	479	15748543.00
IRAN	202	7108006.69
IRAQ	198	6697080.64
JAPAN	381	13121798.00
JORDAN	102	3597312.36
KENYA	559	19505770.98
MOROCCO	191	6514803.15
